  "description": "Full planning permission and listed building consent is sought for the following:\n“Temporary installation for a period from 1st April 2026 through to 25th September 2026 for the erection (including installation and de-installation) of a series of tables and seating, food and drink kiosks, a digital exterior screen, trader vehicles, branded hoardings, branded and non-branded windbreaks, festoon lighting, a dedicated Pimm’s lawn area, a storage container, a back-of-house storage area and additional planters at an area extending the forecourts that front the Royal National Theatre and Queen’s Walk, an area of the Royal National Theatre’s Weston Terrace and an area along Theatre Avenue in conjunction with the spring/summer event at the Royal National Theatre, London.”\n\nIn parallel, advertisement consent is sought for:\n“Temporary erection for a period from 1st April 2026 through to 25th September 2026 for the erection (including installation and de-installation) of a series of branded hoardings, branded windbreaks and signage in conjunction with the spring/summer event at the Royal National Theatre, London.”\n\n",
